    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After WWII the community expanded and was renamed Carmel Valley Village to reflect its broader residential focus beyond aviation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Carmel_Valley_Village,_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1882 the Pacific Improvement Company bought Rancho Los Laureles to boost dairy production for its Del Monte operations.",
